# Ribbon OS: GameMode may switch the CPU scheduler mode without a password, for the people of the desktop (the group audio:
# every account Ribbon makes is in it, and its limits are what a game needs), not for every account on the machine: a service
# account or a sandboxed program of another user has no business restarting scx or changing the power profile.
%audio ALL=(root) NOPASSWD: /usr/bin/ribbon-scheduler gamemode on, /usr/bin/ribbon-scheduler gamemode off
